## 5. SKADI CONSUMPTION UPDATE

### 5.1 New Expected Input Contract

```ts
aegis: {
  final_decision: "PASS" | "BLOCK",
  warning_signal?: {
    status: "ok" | "warning" | "critical",
    score: number,
    action: string
  }
}
```

### 5.2 SKADI Behavior

```ts
if (aegis.final_decision === "BLOCK") {
  abort_execution();
}

if (aegis.warning_signal?.status === "warning") {
  emit_event_spine({
    type: "observe",
    severity: "low"
  });
}

if (aegis.warning_signal?.status === "critical") {
  reroute_via_odin();
}
```

